#: apps/punches/corrections.py:133
msgid ""
"Art. 4.b: a change needs the authorisation of the company and of the person "
"concerned. Empty means they have not answered."
msgstr "Art. 4.b: modificar un asento necesita a autorización da empresa e da persoa afectada. Baleiro significa que aínda non respondeu."

#: apps/punches/corrections.py:137
msgid "answered at"
msgstr "respondeu o"

#: apps/punches/corrections.py:139
msgid "the person's account"
msgstr "versión da persoa"

#: apps/punches/corrections.py:142
msgid ""
"Their version, kept beside the change and never instead of it. Art. 4.b lets "
"the company record the modification and the person their disagreement, so "
"the record holds both."
msgstr "A súa versión, gardada xunto ao cambio e nunca no seu lugar. O art. 4.b permite que a empresa reflicta a modificación e a persoa a súa discrepancia, de xeito que o rexistro conserva as dúas."

#: apps/punches/corrections.py:149
msgid "workers' representatives informed at"
msgstr "representación legal informada o"

#: apps/punches/corrections.py:152
msgid "how they were informed"
msgstr "como se lles informou"

#: apps/punches/corrections.py:156
msgid ""
"Art. 4.b requires informing the workers' legal representation when there is "
"disagreement. If the company has not said who they are, that is recorded "
"here rather than passed over in silence."
msgstr "O art. 4.b esixe informar a representación legal das persoas traballadoras cando hai discrepancia. Se a empresa non dixo quen son, queda anotado aquí en vez de pasalo por alto."

#: apps/punches/corrections.py:163
msgid "applied without agreement"
msgstr "aplicada sen acordo"

#: apps/punches/corrections.py:166
msgid ""
"The change went in anyway, which art. 4.b allows. It travels to the "
